ENTRY            32937   20260914   20261124   20261124       3224
SUBENT        32937001   20260914   20261124   20261124       3224
BIB                 14         36
TITLE      Cross section and isomeric ratio measurements along
            with covariance analysis for the (n,2n) reactions on
            120,130Te
AUTHOR     (Junhua Luo, Long He, Liang Zhou, Li Jiang)
INSTITUTE  (3CPRHXU,3CPRNPC)
           (3CPRCPR) Department of Basic Science, Lanzhou
            Institute of Technology, Lanzhou
REFERENCE  (J,EPJ/A,61,30,2025)
           #doi:10.1140/epja/s10050-025-01501-z
FACILITY   (NGEN,3CPRNPC) K-400 neutron generator
INC-SOURCE (D-T) The neutron-production target was a tritium-
            titanium (T-Ti) target 2.65 mg/cm2 in thickness and
            an active zone diameter was 1.2 cm. The neutron yield
            remains between (4-5) E10 n/s. The average energy of
            the deuterium beam is 135 keV, and the beam intensity
            is maintained at 240 uA.
INC-SPECT  (EN-RSL-HW) Spread considering the location of the
            sample group and the solid angle corresponding to
            the sample size.
SAMPLE     Naturally abundant tellurium with a purity of 99.99%
            is processed into discs with a mass of approximately
            4 g and a diameter of 20 mm. There are 5 such samples
            with a thickness of about 0.2 cm.
METHOD     (ACTIV) The irradiation duration lasting 2 or 3 h.
DETECTOR   (HPGE) The relative efficiency of the detector used
            in the experiment is 68%, and the energy resolution
            is 1.69 keV for the 1332.5 keV of Co-60.
           (SIBAR) The neutron fluence is monitored with an
            accompanying alpha particle count at 135 deg. The
            alpha particles are measured with an Au-Si surface
            barrier detector in the tube and the measurement
            results.
MONITOR    (41-NB-93(N,2N)41-NB-92-M,,SIG)
DECAY-MON  (41-NB-92-M,10.15D,DG,934.44,0.9915)
MONIT-REF  (,,3,IRDFF-II,,2020)
HISTORY    (20260914C) Compiled by Xi Tao (CNDC)
ENDBIB              36
NOCOMMON             0          0
ENDSUBENT           39
